                {
                    "className": "org.joget.apps.userview.lib.HtmlPage",
                    "properties": {
                        "userviewCacheDuration": "20",
                        "userviewCacheScope": "",
                        "label": "<i class=\"fas fa-check\"><\/i> Welcome",
                        "id": "701C34EFFED540E944917D3208046737",
                        "enableOffline": "",
                        "customId": "welcome",
                        "content": "<style>\n        h1 {\n            font-size: 3rem;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            text-shadow: 2px 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        p {\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            max-width: 1000px;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n\n        .enter-btn {\n            background-color: #27ae60;\n            color: white;\n            border: none;\n            padding: 15px 30px;\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: background 0.3s ease, transform 0.2s ease;\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n        }\n\n        .enter-btn:hover {\n            background-color: #2ecc71;\n            transform: translateY(-3px);\n        }\n\n        .footer {\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 15px;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n        }\n    <\/style>\n<h1>Bienvenue sur VM Monitor 🚀<\/h1>\n<p>Surveillez, contr&ocirc;lez et g&eacute;rez vos machines virtuelles et conteneurs Docker de mani&egrave;re simple, rapide et s&eacute;curis&eacute;e.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http://localhost:8081/jw/web/userview/machines_virtuelles_management/app/_/liste_des_machines_virtuelles\"> <button class=\"enter-btn\">Acc&eacute;der au tableau de bord<\/button> <\/a><\/p>\n<div class=\"footer\">&copy; 2025 - VM Monitor | Cr&eacute;&eacute; par Mohamed Trabelsi<\/div>"
                    }
                },
